WEBVTT

00:00:00.215 --> 00:00:01.840
Stop. Count your tabs.

00:00:02.115 --> 00:00:03.203
LeetCode. GitHub.

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:04.466
A resume you rewrote...

00:00:04.466 --> 00:00:05.628
four times.

00:00:05.986 --> 00:00:07.496
A course you never finished.

00:00:07.496 --> 00:00:09.221
And an AI that forgets you...

00:00:09.221 --> 00:00:10.696
every single chat.

00:00:11.309 --> 00:00:12.550
That's not preparation.

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:13.775
That's chaos.

00:00:15.837 --> 00:00:16.312
Meet Placiq.

00:00:16.312 --> 00:00:17.424
The career OS...

00:00:17.424 --> 00:00:19.487
that actually remembers you.

00:00:20.503 --> 00:00:22.236
It starts with a diagnosis.

00:00:22.236 --> 00:00:23.586
Where you are, right now, for the

00:00:23.586 --> 00:00:24.786
role you want.

00:00:25.341 --> 00:00:26.697
Then it prioritizes.

00:00:26.697 --> 00:00:28.785
No more guessing what to learn next.

00:00:29.225 --> 00:00:30.637
Learn DSA by watching it move.

00:00:30.637 --> 00:00:31.675
Every pointer.

00:00:31.675 --> 00:00:32.875
Every swap.

00:00:34.051 --> 00:00:36.043
1,800+ interactive animations.

00:00:37.438 --> 00:00:39.470
With a Socratic tutor that asks you...

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:40.870
before it tells you.

00:00:42.931 --> 00:00:45.849
Build real projects, checkpoint by checkpoint, with

00:00:45.849 --> 00:00:47.637
a tutor that knows your code.

00:00:48.083 --> 00:00:48.895
Every commit.

00:00:48.895 --> 00:00:49.745
Every fix.

00:00:49.745 --> 00:00:50.807
Every decision...

00:00:50.807 --> 00:00:52.245
becomes evidence.

00:00:52.922 --> 00:00:55.299
Resume Intelligence checks your claims, with a

00:00:55.299 --> 00:00:56.524
recruiter's eye.

00:00:56.793 --> 00:00:58.847
And your Skill Passport shows the work.

00:00:58.847 --> 00:01:00.235
Not just the words.

00:01:02.285 --> 00:01:03.896
Diagnose. Prioritize.

00:01:03.896 --> 00:01:04.646
Learn. Build.

00:01:04.646 --> 00:01:05.633
Prove. Present.

00:01:05.633 --> 00:01:06.558
Repeat.

00:01:06.954 --> 00:01:08.763
Your DSA, your projects, your GitHub, your

00:01:08.763 --> 00:01:09.413
resume, your goals...

00:01:09.413 --> 00:01:10.988
finally, connected.

00:01:12.277 --> 00:01:13.773
Placiq. Your work...

00:01:14.535 --> 00:01:17.110
connected. Start free at learn.placiq.in
